[ti:Hark! The Herald Angels Sing]
[ar:Charles Wesley (1739), music Felix Mendelssohn (1840)]
[length:01:54]
[by:SingLearn - Nhom 10 (auto-aligned, faster-whisper)]
[00:58.02]Hark! The herald angels sing,
[01:02.50]"Glory to the newborn King;
[01:07.62]Peace on earth, and mercy mild,
[01:12.83]God and sinners reconciled!"
[01:18.04]Joyful, all ye nations rise,
[01:22.60]Join the triumph of the skies;
[01:27.58]With angelic host proclaim,
[01:32.16]"Christ is born in Bethlehem!"
[01:37.84]Hark! The herald angels sing,
[01:43.86]"Glory to the newborn King!"
[01:50.44]
